    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537270/research-assistant-iii-in-the-school-of-nursing": {
      "title": "Research Assistant I/II in the School of Nursing",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Research Assistant I/II in the School of Nursing The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537270 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Nursing (20800) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Research Assistant I/II in the School of Nursing (Ref.: 537270) (to commence as soon as possible for 12 months, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Nursing, Health Sciences, Psychology, Public Health, Exercise Science, Rehabilitation Sciences, Social Sciences, or other related disciplines. They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Cantonese); strong interpersonal, communication and organizational skills; and the ability to prioritize multiple tasks efficiently to meet tight deadlines. They should be attentive to details; self-motivated; responsible; able to work independently as well as in a team; and competent to perform administrative duties and collaborate with different stakeholders.  Experience in clinical/oncology research, eHealth interventions, exercise or mindfulness programmes, and/or statistical software will be an advantage. The appointee will work under the research team led by Prof. Hammoda Abu-Odah. The appointee will assist in research projects relating to cancer/oncology research. He/She will assist in participant recruitment, tracking project progress, data entry, and perform other duties as assigned by the Principal Investigator. Those with less experience or lower qualifications may be considered for appointment as Research Assistant II. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date CV.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 15, 2026 or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 1, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 15, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537270 Research Assistant I/II in the School of Nursing School of Nursing (20800) Oct 15, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537270 Research Assistant I/II in the School of Nursing School of Nursing (20800) Oct 15, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
