    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537267/research-assistant-iii-holding-the-functional-title-of-project-assistant": {
      "title": "Research Assistant I/II (holding the functional title of Project Assistant)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Research Assistant I/II (holding the functional title of Project Assistant) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537267 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Nursing (20800) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Research Assistant I/II (holding the functional title of Project Assistant) (several posts) in the School of Nursing (Ref.: 537267) (to commence as soon as possible for one year with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree in Nursing, Social Sciences, Social Work, Psychology, or a related discipline. They should have an excellent command of both spoken and written English and Chinese (including fluency in Cantonese), along with strong interpersonal and organisational skills.  They should be responsible, self-motivated, and able to work independently as well as collaboratively in a team. Prior experience in working with non-governmental organisations (NGOs), or working with people with disabilities, is highly preferred. The appointee will work for the “Jockey Club Health Programme for Adult Persons with Disabilities” under the supervision of Professor Kelvin Wang. He/she will assist in implementing research activities, analysing data, preparing scientific reports, liaising with community partners and institutions, general administration, and performing other duties as assigned. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until December 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 1, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537267 Research Assistant I/II (holding the functional title of Project Assistant) School of Nursing (20800) Dec 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537267 Research Assistant I/II (holding the functional title of Project Assistant) School of Nursing (20800) Dec 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
