      "title": "Laboratory Assistant",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Laboratory Assistant The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537328 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Nursing (20800) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Laboratory Assistant in the School of Nursing (Ref.: 537328) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance and funding availability) Applicants should have 5 passes in HKCEE including English (min. Grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007) and Chinese (Level 2 from 2007), OR min. Level 2 in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language and Chinese Language.  They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese, good organizational and interpersonal skills, a strong sense of responsibility, IT proficiency, proficiency in video production, and the ability to work independently and in a team.  Knowledge of inventory management system and experience in handling equipment in a nursing clinical laboratory and/or a simulation training centre would be preferred. The appointee will support the operation and maintenance of the School’s state-of-the-art clinical laboratory and simulation training centre; assist in the setup of teaching activities in the nursing laboratory; assist with procurement of equipment, operation of electronic devices, record keeping and data entry; and perform other duties as assigned.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to an interview. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536624) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from September 26, 2026 and continue until November 7, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 12, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 7, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537328 Laboratory Assistant School of Nursing (20800) Nov 7, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537328 Laboratory Assistant School of Nursing (20800) Nov 7, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
