    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537261/executive-assistant-at-the-rank-of-clerk-ii": {
      "title": "Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Engineering 1 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537261 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering (14300) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) in Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering (Ref.: 537261) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a Higher Diploma or an equivalent qualification, or 5 passes in HKCEE, including English (min. Grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007), Chinese (Level 2 from 2007) and Mathematics OR min. Level 2 or equivalent in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language, Chinese Language and Mathematics, plus at least 4 years of full-time work experience, preferably in the tertiary education sector. They should have a good command of both written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua); good organisational, interpersonal, communication and problem-solving skills; proficiency in IT and familiarity with office applications; and ability to work independently and under pressure to meet tight deadlines. They should also have a strong sense of responsibility, attention to detail and the ability to multitask.  Immediately available is preferred. The appointee will assist in financial and administrative matters of the Department, including handling payments and processing receipts, preparing accountment statements and reimbursement claims, maintaining database for finance records, and managing office inventory. He/She will also provide support for tasks as assigned by supervisor(s) and perform other duties as assigned by the Head of the Department or his/her delegates. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until October 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 15, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537261 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering (14300) Oct 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537261 Executive Assistant (at the rank of Clerk II) Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering (14300) Oct 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
