      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537381 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) in the School of Biomedical Sciences (Ref.: 537381) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should possess a recognized degree, or 5 passes in HKCEE including English (min. Grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007), Chinese (Level 2 from 2007) and Mathematics; OR min. Level 2 or equivalent in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language, Chinese Language and Mathematics with at least 2 years’ work experience. They should have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese; good communication, organizational, and problem-solving skills; as well as an appropriate level of IT skills. They should also be a good team player with self-motivation and a strong sense of responsibility. Degree holders will be offered the functional title of Executive Assistant. The appointee will provide support in human resources and perform other ad hoc and non-routine tasks as required. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536599) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 16, 2026 . Advertised: Sep 17, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 16, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537381 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Nov 16, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537381 Clerk II (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) School of Biomedical Sciences (22600) Nov 16, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
