    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537428/laboratory-assistant": {
      "title": "Laboratory Assistant",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Laboratory Assistant The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537428 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Laboratory Assistant in the HKUMed Laboratory of Cellular Therapeutics of the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537428) (to commence as soon as possible on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should have 5 passes in HKCEE, including English (min. grade C if Syllabus A/Level 2 from 2007), Chinese (Level 2 from 2007) and Mathematics, or min. Level 2 in 5 subjects in HKDSEE including English Language, Chinese Language and Mathematics, preferably with a diploma or above in biological, medical or laboratory sciences, preferably with at least 2 years’ relevant experience. They should have a good command of spoken English and Chinese, good communication and interpersonal skills, and proficiency in PC and commonly used software applications. Work experience in GMP laboratories would be an advantage. The appointee will join the HKUMed Laboratory of Cellular Therapeutics and be responsible for laboratory supporting duties including specimen organization, record keeping, data entry, general cleaning and sterilization of cleanrooms and equipment, and other duties as assigned. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to date C.V. Review of applications will commence on October 5, 2026 and continue until October 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 22, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537428 Laboratory Assistant Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537428 Laboratory Assistant Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
