      "title": "Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/ Executive Officer) (several posts)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/ Executive Officer) (several posts) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537452 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/ Executive Officer) (several posts) in the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537452) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good university degree with at least 5 years’ work experience in the higher education sector or a public/ quasi-public organisation. They should have an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese; exceptional interpersonal, organisational, and problem-solving skills; and the ability to produce high-quality outputs in a fast-paced environment and be able to work under pressure. Proven experience and track record in one or more of the following areas would be an advantage: (i) fundraising and donor stewardship; (ii) event management; (iii) corporate communications; (iv) publications; and (v) PR or media relations. The appointees will provide a high level of administrative support to corporate communications, fundraising campaign, donor stewardship, event management and marketing materials, and attend to ad-hoc duties outside office hours or on weekends from time to time. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview and/ or written test. Those with less experience may be considered for appointment as Assistant Manager. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above posts. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. and portfolio. Review of applications will start from October 8, 2026 and continue until October 23, 2026 , or until the posts are filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 24, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 23, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537452 Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/ Executive Officer) (several posts) Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 23, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537452 Manager/ Assistant Manager (at the rank of Administrative Assistant II/ Executive Officer) (several posts) Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 23, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
