    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537467/executive-officer": {
      "title": "HKU Careers",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Executive Officer The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537467 Work type: Full-time Department: Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Executive Officer in the LKS Faculty of Medicine (Ref.: 537467) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance) Applicants should possess a good Bachelor’s degree, with at least 5 years’ solid administrative work experience. A good understanding of the education sector is preferred. Applicants should have an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese; strong communication, organizational and problem-solving skills; as well as an appropriate level of IT skills. They are also expected to have experience in managing a small team, the ability to prioritize multiple tasks efficiently to meet strict deadlines with minimal supervision, and a good sense of tact in dealing with sensitive and confidential issues, including discreet handling of personal and confidential files. The appointee will perform a wide range of duties including managing different processes, liaising with both internal and external stakeholders for resources acquisition, and IT procurement. Other duties include execution of strategic projects, team administration, and preparation of reports and presentation. He/She shall directly report to the Faculty Information Officer. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview and/or written test. Applicants who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536675) need not re-apply. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 23, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 24, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 23, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537467 Executive Officer Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 23, 2026 Featured jobs Provost and Deputy Vice-Chancellor Vice-President and Pro-Vice-Chancellor (Global) Chief Information Officer and University Librarian Director of the Development & Alumni Affairs Office HKU Global Professoriate Recruitment Campaign Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537467 Executive Officer Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine (20000) Oct 23, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
