    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537427/postdoctoral-fellow-in-photonics-in-the-department-of-physics": {
      "title": "Post-doctoral Fellow in Photonics in the Department of Physics",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Faculty of Science 1 Post-doctoral Fellow in Photonics in the Department of Physics The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537427 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Physics (25600) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow Hong Kong Three positions are available as Post-doctoral Fellows in Photonics in the Department of Physics (Ref.: 537427) , to commence as soon as possible for 12 months, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance. Applicants should possess a Ph.D. degree in Physics, or relevant areas. Those with experience in optoelectronic devices, topological photonics, non-Hermtian physics are welcome to apply. The appointees will work with Prof. Shuang Zhang to pursue research in active photonic devices.  Prof. Zhang’s research interests cover a wide range of topics in photonics, including, but not limited to, topological metamaterials, metasurfaces, non-linear optics, etc.  The current publications of Prof. Zhang group’s can be found at: https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=sepjZ3sAAAAJ&hl=en A competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V., a cover letter and a list of publications.  They should also arrange 2 referees to send reference letters to Prof. Zhang by e-mail (shuzhang@hku.hk) directly.  Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until March 18, 2027 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 24, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Mar 18, 2027 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537427 Post-doctoral Fellow in Photonics in the Department of Physics Department of Physics (25600) Mar 18, 2027 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537427 Post-doctoral Fellow in Photonics in the Department of Physics Department of Physics (25600) Mar 18, 2027 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
