and organising events, such as campus visits, seminars and conferences.  He/She will also perform other ad-hoc duties as assigned.  Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue untill October 14, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 24, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 14, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537461 Clerk II, Academic Area Administration (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 14, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537461 Clerk II, Academic Area Administration (holding the functional title of Executive Assistant) Faculty of Business and Economics (07000) Oct 14, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
