    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537516/postdoctoral-fellow-in-representation-theory-position": {
      "title": "Post-doctoral Fellow in Representation Theory Position",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Faculty of Science 1 Post-doctoral Fellow in Representation Theory Position The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537516 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Mathematics (25500) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow Hong Kong Department of Mathematics The University of Hong Kong Postdoctoral Position in Representation Theory Position (Ref.: 537516) Position Applications are invited for the appointment as a Post-doctoral Fellow in the Department of Mathematics. The positions are awarded for 2 years, and may be considered through performance evaluation for an extension of another year. The applicant is expected to commence as soon as possible, but the starting date is negotiable. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The appointee will be working under the supervision of Prof. Xuhua He https://hkumath.hku.hk/~xuhuahe/ Qualification 1. Applicants should possess a Ph.D. degree in Mathematics. 2. Candidates are expected to have a strong research background in the area of Representation Theory. Application The following documents are required: 1. An up-to-date C.V. 2. A cover letter 3. A list of publications 4. Three academic references are required. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online at the University’s careers site and upload an up-to-date C.V., a research statement, and at least two academic references. Review of applications will start on November 30, 2026 , and continue until the positions are filled. The University is an equal opportunities employer and is committed to equality, ethics, inclusivity, diversity and transparency Advertised: Sep 29, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 30, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537516 Post-doctoral Fellow in Representation Theory Position Department of Mathematics (25500) Nov 30, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537516 Post-doctoral Fellow in Representation Theory Position Department of Mathematics (25500) Nov 30, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
