      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Fractional / Part-time 1 Full-time 1 Categories Professional & Management 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Part-time / Full-time Pharmacist The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537528 Work type: Fractional / Part-time, Full-time Department: Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (21300) Categories: Professional & Management Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Part-time/ Full-time Pharmacist in the Department of Pharmacology and Pharmacy (Ref.: 537528), to commence on a six-month temporary basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance. Applicants should possess a Master’s degree in Pharmacy or a healthcare-related post-graduate degree, and be a registered pharmacist in Hong Kong, with at least 5 years’ work experience in pharmacy practice. Relevant experience in pharmacy teaching or research would be an advantage.  Applicants with less than 5 years of experience, but with solid experience in pharmacy, may also be considered. The appointee is expected to contribute to community pharmacy service development, capacity building, as well as to participate in teaching or research initiatives. He/She is expected to possess excellent communication and interpersonal skills. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits, if applicable. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date CV. Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until November 30, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 5, 2026 (H