    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537567/parttime-research-assistant-i": {
      "title": "Part-time Research Assistant I",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Fractional / Part-time 1 Categories Research Staff 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Part-time Research Assistant I The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537567 Work type: Fractional / Part-time Department: School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Categories: Research Staff Hong Kong Part-time Research Assistant I in the School of Chinese Medicine (Ref: 537567) (to commence as soon as possible, for a period of one year.) Applicants should possess a Bachelor's degree or higher in Chinese medicine, Psychology, Behavioural Science or a related discipline. Applicants should have a solid background in clinical research, and community research studies, with experience in data entry and monitoring. They should demonstrate the ability to conduct clinical research in the screening of eligible participants and collecting data, as well as in grant applications and funding proposals.  Prior experience in adolescent engagement is preferred. Proficiency in MS office software tools, and an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese is required. The appointee will assist in research projects related to adolescents with psychological distress.  He / She will be involved in participant recruitment and screening, outcome assessments and biospecimen handling; prepare publications and reports; and perform other duties as assigned under the PI’s supervision.  Enquiries about the duties of the post can be sent to scmhr@hku.hk . A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits if applicable. The University only accepts online applications for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until October 19, 2026 or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier . The University thanks applicants for their interest, but advises that only candidates shortlisted for interviews will be notified of the application results. Advertised: Oct 5, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 19, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537567 Part-time Research Assistant I School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Oct 19, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537567 Part-time Research Assistant I School of Chinese Medicine (22100) Oct 19, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
