    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537463/assistant-manager-at-the-rank-of-executive-officer": {
      "title": "Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Faculty of Engineering 1 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537463 Work type: Full-time Department: Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) in the Department of Mechanical Engineering (Ref.: 537463) (to commence as soon as possible, on a two-year fixed-term basis with contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary, with the possibility of renewal) Applicants should possess a Bachelor's degree with at least 5 years of relevant post-qualification work experience in the tertiary education sector and/or executive support. Prior experience in high-level secretarial support and Research Postgraduate (RPg) programme administration is highly desirable. They should demonstrate an excellent command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua), exceptional interpersonal and communication skills, and sound judgment in handling confidential matters, and possess strong organizational, analytical, and problem-solving abilities, with keen attention to detail. The successful applicant must demonstrate maturity, professionalism, and the ability to work effectively under pressure and tight deadlines. A proactive, adaptable, and service-oriented work attitude is essential. Key responsibilities include: Providing comprehensive personal secretarial and executive support to the Head of Department; Managing the full spectrum of Research Postgraduate (RPg) academic programme administration; Supporting major events, promotional activities, and public relations initiatives; Providing secretarial and administrative support to departmental committees and working groups; Liaising with internal and external stakeholders on departmental and programme-related matters; and Performing other duties as assigned. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend a written test and an interview. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post. Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V. Review of applications will commence as soon as possible and continue until November 15, 2026 or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Oct 5, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Nov 15, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537463 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Nov 15, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537463 Assistant Manager (at the rank of Executive Officer) Department of Mechanical Engineering (14500) Nov 15, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
